### ============================================
### TEST KEYCLOAK - Verificación y Autenticación
### ============================================

### 1. Verificar que Keycloak está corriendo
GET http://localhost:8081/health/ready

### 2. Obtener configuración del realm (debe existir)
GET http://localhost:8081/realms/bda-realm

### 3. Obtener las claves públicas (JWK Set)
GET http://localhost:8081/realms/bda-realm/protocol/openid-connect/certs

### ============================================
### AUTENTICACIÓN - Obtener Token JWT
### ============================================

### 4. Login como CLIENTE
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/bda-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=bda-client&grant_type=password&username=cliente&password=cliente

### 5. Login como ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/bda-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=bda-client&grant_type=password&username=admin&password=admin

### 6. Login como TRANSPORTISTA
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/bda-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=bda-client&grant_type=password&username=transportista&password=transportista

### ============================================
### PRUEBAS CON EL GATEWAY (usar token obtenido arriba)
### ============================================

### 7. Crear solicitud a través del Gateway (requiere token de CLIENTE o ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/solicitudes/crear
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idCliente": 1,
  "idContenedor": 1
}

### 8. Listar camiones a través del Gateway (requiere token de ADMIN o TRANSPORTISTA)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/camiones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Generar rutas tentativas (requiere token de ADMIN o TRANSPORTISTA)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rutas/tentativas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitudOrigen": -31.4201,
  "longitudOrigen": -64.1888,
  "latitudDestino": -34.6037,
  "longitudDestino": -58.3816
}

